# libui-ng (MIT), fetched by meson setup at a fixed commit (a GitHub archive, so no git is
# needed). The patch lets it build as a subproject: its macOS flags become project arguments
# (meson refuses global ones there), and it installs nothing of its own (meson install puts
# just the app in place).
